    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so do i have to pull the whole thing out from under the cabinets to get to the base, or can i just tilt it a bit? and is there a specific way to dry it out once i get the water out? i don't want to cause more damage.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
